  "entity_raw": {
    "name_raw": "Quick Reposition",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder Roleplaying Game Ultimate Combat",
    "definition_raw": "Your opponent becomes an unwitting dance partner, following your lead while you fight.\n\nPrerequisite: Int 13, Combat Expertise, Improved Reposition, base attack bonus +6.\n\nBenefit: On your turn, you can perform a single reposition combat maneuver in place of one of your melee attacks. You must choose the melee attack with the highest base attack bonus to make the reposition.\n\nNormal: A reposition combat maneuver is a standard action.",
